  "question": {
    "text": "Four persons can hit a target correctly with probabilities <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> and <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> respectively. If all hit at the target independently, then the probability that the target would be hit, is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>192</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>192</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>25</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>32</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "D"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo></math>target is hit<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8211;</mo><mi>P</mi><mo>(</mo></math>no one hit the target<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#183;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>7</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p><p>Thus, the required probability is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>32</mn></mfrac><mo>.</mo></math></p>"
  }
